 # Aegis Golden Path (v1)
 
+## Autonomy ops patch: controller deployment + SLO/safety signals + infra scaffolds
+
+This patch:
+- Moves rollout controller out-of-process:
+  - `api/golden_controller_main.py`
+  - Helm `aegis-controller` Deployment
+- Adds explicit Prometheus counters for:
+  - inference errors
+  - canary checks + outcomes
+  - safety blocks
+- Adds safety regression signal into canary decision loop (uses SafetyEvent if present)
+- Adds Terraform advanced placeholders for:
+  - Karpenter
+  - managed node groups
+
+NOTE:
+- For true error-rate decisioning, integrate controller with Prometheus queries (next step).
+- SafetyEvent must exist in your DB schema; if not, adapt `api/golden_safety_signals.py` to your safety logging table.
+
